Maintainer: Apollon D.M.T.Hegbe <apollonrossi@gmail.com>
Description: A Shiny-based toolkit for deterministic keyword searches (Fungi, 
    Animals, Plants) with full audit logs, and optional AI-assisted (DeepSeek) 
    evaluation using the Micheli Guide framework. It automates the assessment 
    of CBD National Reports and NBSAPs to identify gaps in fungal conservation 
    policy.
